# Ad-hoc verification scripts/artifacts occasionally created at the repo
# root or under services/device while testing against a live dev server —
# real access/refresh tokens have landed in these before (see git history:
# services/device/token.txt, admin-login.json on feat/async-ui-progress-
# and-fixes). Never commit a live credential; keep this kind of scratch
# output out of git entirely instead of relying on remembering to delete it.
